  "notes": "Local production and imports by year from the Agriculture and Agrifood Department's 2020 editions. Local share = local ÷ (local + imports), computed by the author; no export figures are published, so it is not a full self-sufficiency ratio. Egg values are yearly despite the 'Monthly' label. Beef starts in 2000 (imports n/a before) and sums live and chilled & frozen imports; chilled & frozen imports are first recorded in 2005."
